---
 .../ABI/testing/sysfs-bus-coresight-devices-tpdm    | 13 +++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 Documentation/ABI/testing/sysfs-bus-coresight-devices-tpdm

